<Base title="About this site" context="about" description="Who runs alevelenglishtutor.com and where the questions, texts and mark schemes come from.">
  <h1>About this site</h1>
  <p>alevelenglishtutor.com is run by {site.company}, an A-level tutoring business with a small team of specialist tutors. The site exists to give AQA English Language and English Literature A students the past-paper material they actually use, sorted the way they revise, free and without sign-up; and to introduce students who want more help to an experienced English tutor.</p>
  <h2>Where the material comes from</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>AQA English Language</strong> (A level 7702, AS 7701) and <strong>AQA English Literature A</strong> (A level 7712, AS 7711): AQA's own published question papers, inserts, mark schemes and examiners' reports for every series since June 2016. AQA no longer hosts the June 2016 to 2019 papers; those come from copies of AQA's original papers kept online, and are labelled.</li>
    <li>Some texts and extracts are missing from AQA's published papers for copyright reasons; the questions are still here, and the card says so.</li>
    <li>Each question is tagged to the specification content or set text it covers, its assessment objectives and its question type, and linked to the texts and extracts it uses. Notes on common errors come from the mark schemes and the examiners' reports.</li>
    <li><strong>Grade boundaries and exam dates</strong> are AQA's published figures.</li>
    <li>Anything written for the site, such as topic notes, is original and written by our tutors; nothing derived from the boards' material is generated automatically.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This site is not affiliated with AQA. The June 2026 papers will be added when AQA releases them, expected after the summer 2027 exams.</p>
  <h2>Who writes it</h2>
  <p>The tutoring is by specialist English tutors; see the <a href="/tutors/">tutors page</a>. The site is built and maintained by the same small team that runs <a href="https://www.alevelbiologytutor.com" rel="noopener">alevelbiologytutor.com</a>, <a href="https://www.mathsaleveltutor.com" rel="noopener">mathsaleveltutor.com</a>, <a href="https://www.alevelpsychologytutor.com" rel="noopener">alevelpsychologytutor.com</a> <a href="https://www.economicsaleveltutor.com" rel="noopener">economicsaleveltutor.com</a> and <a href="https://www.alevelgeographytutor.com" rel="noopener">alevelgeographytutor.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>Mistakes</h2>
  <p>If you find one, tell us on the <a href="/report/">report a mistake</a> page; corrections usually go live the same week.</p>
</Base>
